Consider the following code snippet. What would be the output for fun(5)?
```c
int fun(int n) {
  int x = 1, k;
  if (n == 1) return x;
  for (k = 1; k < n; ++k)
    x = x + fun(k) * fun(n - k);
  return x;
}
```

